  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow transfixes your foot, crunching through the tarsal bones of the ankle. Your foot is momentarily nailed to the ground, pinning you in place.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> You suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.7mCcI3q7hgWcmbBU]{Broken Bone (Minor)} and while still upright you are unable to move from the spot. At any time you can voluntarily go @Condition[Prone] to break the pin, after which you can crawl away as usual.</p><p>Extraction will be <strong>Challenging (+0)</strong>.</p>"
    },
